Cache Type Key TTL Savings Exact match hash(prompt + model + params) 1h–24h 100% on hit Semantic embedding similarity &gt; 0.95 1h–6h 80–100% on near-duplicates Embedding cache hash(text) 7d Avoid re-embedding RAG retrieval cache hash(query) 15m–1h Skip retrieval + generation <pre><code>import hashlib
import json


def cache_key(prompt: str, model: str, params: dict) -&gt; str:
  payload = json.dumps({"prompt": prompt, "model": model, **params}, sort_keys=True)
  return hashlib.sha256(payload.encode()).hexdigest()
</code></pre> <p>Caution: Never cache responses containing user-specific PII without scoping the cache key to <code>user_id</code>.</p>

